#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:174
msgid ""
"It had been seventeen years since the ascent of Garard I to the throne of "
"Wesnoth, which put to rest an era rife with turmoil within the kingdom."
msgstr ""
"Garard 1世が Wesnoth 王国の王に即位して国内の混乱に満ちた時代が終わってから17"
"年が経過しました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:177
msgid ""
"In the town of Soradoc, two young boys of common descent, Turod and Caror, "
"were beginning their training in the town guard.\n"
"\n"
"They both dream of bringing money to their family, having an adventure, "
"protecting the citizenry and every other thing passing through young boys' "
"heads."
msgstr ""
"Soradoc の町では、共通の血を引く Turod と Caror という2人の少年が、町の衛兵隊"
"で訓練を始めていました。\n"
"\n"
"二人は、家族にお金をもたらすこと、冒険をすること、市民を守ることなどなど、少"
"年なら頭に思い描く全てのことを夢見ています。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:182
msgid ""
"Caror had been my best friend since childhood, strongest amongst us "
"children, but quite smart nonetheless.\n"
"\n"
"He had a knack for making friends which sometimes bordered on being too "
"familiar with strangers.\n"
"\n"
"Though his strength marked him as a promising heavy infantryman, he was not "
"without wit."
msgstr ""
"Caror とは幼い頃からの親友で、僕たち子供の中で一番強く、それなのにとても頭が"
"良い少年でした。\n"
"\n"
"彼は友達作りが上手で、時には見知ら人とも親しくなり過ぎるくらいです。\n"
"\n"
"その力強さから重歩兵として有望視されていましたが、決して賢くないわけではあり"
"ませんでした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:191
msgid ""
"What about me.. well... is that not the point of this tale?\n"
"\n"
"Suffice to say I was quite the reader and I would always find time to sneak "
"into a library."
msgstr ""
"僕はどうだったかというと......それはこの物語にはどうでもいいこと、でしょ"
"う？\n"
"\n"
"僕はかなりの読書家で、時間を見つけてはいつも図書館に忍び込んでいた、とまあ、"
"そんなところです。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:198
msgid ""
"We had both started our on-the-job training and were going to stand watch "
"when an unwelcome event took form."
msgstr ""
"二人とも実地訓練が始まり、不慮の事態が発生したときに備えて監視役をすることに"
"なりました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:201
msgid ""
"Chapter One\n"
"<i>Rescue</i>"
msgstr ""
"第1章\n"
"<i>救出 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:223
msgid "Nooo! Help!!!"
msgstr "やめろ～！　助けて～！！！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:227
msgid "No! We were meant to protect them!"
msgstr "駄目だ！　僕らは彼らを守るためにあるんだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:245
msgid ""
"Well, it's our turn pretty much now, ain't it... Let's hope it'll be calm!"
msgstr "さて、そろそろ僕らの出番かな...。無事に終わることを祈ろう！"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:255
msgid "Finally, an easy target, grab everything boys!"
msgstr "最後は、チョロい標的だな、ガキども全員をひっ捕まえろ！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:259
msgid ""
"Of course... He's near the flooded road, let's use the abandoned forts to "
"muster the guard!"
msgstr ""
"ああ、そろそろだな... 一人は水没した道の近くにいるが、衛兵集めの目的で残され"
"た砦を使おう！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:275
msgid "Let's get those peasants safe in town and warn the rest of the guard!"
msgstr "農民を町に避難させて、残りの衛兵に警告しよう！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:301
msgid ""
"They call for an emergency and don't even say why... I am General Morain of "
"the Wesnothian Army, is the situation dealt with?"
msgstr ""
"緊急事態と言いながら、理由も明かさない......。私は Wesnoth 軍の Morain 将軍"
"だ、事態は収拾したのかな？"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:305
msgid ""
"Yes sir, some bandits attacked villagers from a hideout beside the old road "
"but we got our people out."
msgstr ""
"はい閣下、山賊が旧道脇の隠れ家から村人を襲ってきましたが、助け出せました。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:309
msgid ""
"Good, competent people. The army will run down what remains, and in the "
"meantime, I would like to have a talk with both of you."
msgstr ""
"ほう、君たちは、なかなか優秀だな。残党は軍隊が一掃してくれるだろうから、その"
"間、君たちと話をしようじゃないか。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:323
msgid "No! They won't find their way in the dark!"
msgstr "駄目だ！暗闇で道が分からなくなってしまう！"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:338
msgid "How!?"
msgstr "なんでこうなるんだ？"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:348
msgid "There, this is over."
msgstr "ああ、これでお終いだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:368
msgid "Thank you for getting me out!"
msgstr "助けていただき、有難うございます！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:375
msgid "Yes! We got'em out!"
msgstr "よし、みんなを避難させたぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:379
msgid "This is pointless, run away!"
msgstr "こんなの無意味だ、逃げろ！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/01_Rescue.cfg:388
msgid "Thank you for the help, please get my friend out!"
msgstr "有難うございました！私の友人を避難させてください！"

#. [scenario]: id=02_A_Practice_Bout
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:5
msgid "A Practice Bout"
msgstr "練習試合"

#. [side]
#. [scenario]: id=02_A_Practice_Bout
