msgstr "立会人"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:143
msgid ""
"After the skirmish, General Morain offered to take us to an officer training "
"school he was supposed to oversee, saying he saw potential within us. This "
"was a far better offer than life in the town guard, and we took it without a "
"second thought."
msgstr ""
"小競り合いの後、Morain 将軍は僕らには見込みがあるからと、将軍が統括する予定の"
"士官養成学校に連れて行こうとおっしゃった。町の衛兵で終わるよりも遥かに良い話"
"で、僕らは二つ返事で受け入れたのです。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:146
msgid ""
"We diligently worked on our classes for quite some time and were set to "
"deploy in the following months, hopefully without any major incident..."
msgstr ""
"僕らはしばしの期間、勉学に勤しみ、翌月には大きな問題もなく部隊配備される予定"
"でした......。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:149
msgid ""
"And so now we reach the point when they both entered our lives for the first "
"time...\n"
"\n"
"And the beginning of this story."
msgstr ""
"そして今、二人が初めて私たちの人生に登場した瞬間へと辿り着きました...。\n"
"\n"
"さあ、この物語の幕が開きます。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:154
msgid ""
"Chapter Two\n"
"<i>A Practice Bout</i>"
msgstr ""
"第2章\n"
"<i>練習試合 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:171
msgid "Sir, if I might be so bold as to question your orders, why are we here?"
msgstr "閣下、ご指示を仰ぎたく存じますが、なぜ我々はここにいるのでしょうか？"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:175
msgid ""
"To do a little test.\n"
"These new recruits, being of noble blood, feel that they should be in command"
"—"
msgstr ""
"ちょっとした試験を行うためだ。\n"
"この新米どもは、高貴な血筋を引いていて自分が指揮をとるべきだ、と考えているよ"
"うだな —"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:180
msgid ""
"Indeed, we are naturally better suited for such a task and should not be "
"required to follow orders from common recruits!"
msgstr ""
"まさしく。そうした任務には我々の方が向いているし、一般の新兵の命令に従う必要"
"などない！"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:184
msgid ""
"(<i>Mumbling</i>) Brother, could you please stop dishonoring our line every "
"time you speak..."
msgstr ""
"（<i> ブツクサと </i>）お兄さま、喋るたびに私達の品位を汚すのは、やめてもらえ"
"ないかしら...。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:188
msgid ""
"—and though they have been partially trained, we do not know how much, thus "
"we have brought them here to test them against our best trainees."
msgstr ""
"— で、部分的な訓練は受けているが、如何ほどのものかは分からぬ。それゆえ彼らを"
"ここに連れてきて、我々の最高の訓練生と試験をしようとしているのだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:192
msgid "Well then, let's do this fast so we can all get ta know each other!"
msgstr "では、早速始めましょう。そうすれば、お互いを知ることができるでしょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:196
msgid "Begin the battle!"
msgstr "戦闘を開始せよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:246
msgid "And so it ends, the trainees are victorious!"
msgstr "さあ終わりだ、訓練生たちが勝ち誇っているようだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:250
msgid "Perhaps we are not that bad, now are we?"
msgstr "もしかして私達は、意外と使え...ますよね？"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:254
msgid ""
"I told you this was foolish, brother...\n"
"Your pride is misplaced and you would be better served by listening from the "
"experienced ones."
msgstr ""
"このようなこと馬鹿げてると言ったでしょう、お兄さま...\n"
"ご自分のプライドはお捨てになって、経験者の意見を聞いた方がよろしいですわ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:259
msgid "Fine... Do forgive me for my presomptuousness."
msgstr "そのようだな... 俺の早とちりだ、許してくれ。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:263
msgid "Don't care. Why are yall standing about, let's go drink!"
msgstr "気にしないでください。 何突っ立ってるんですか、飲みに行きましょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:283
msgid "I have things to do, why am I here..."
msgstr "やることがあるのに、なぜここにいるんだろう...。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:295
msgid "Sorry about this..."
msgstr "すみません、こんなことになって..."

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:307
msgid "Let us be done with this farce!"
msgstr "こんな茶番、もう終わりにするぜ!"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:321
msgid "Ah!... That hurts..."
msgstr "あっ！ ひどい..."

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:325
msgid "Turod is out."
msgstr "Turod、終わりだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:358
msgid "Urrgh! I'm down!"
msgstr "ううぅぅ！　やられた！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:362
msgid "Caror is out."
msgstr "Caror、終わりだな。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:395
msgid "Aiiie!"
msgstr "いたーい！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:399
msgid "Merinyan is down."
msgstr "Merinyan 、退場だ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:411
msgid "How! This is impossible..."
msgstr "おい！あり得ないだろ..."

#. [message]: speaker=HG1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:415
msgid "Oweomyr is down."
msgstr "Oweomyr 、退場だ。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:424
msgid ""
"If fresh recruits can hold you at bay then perhaps they are right, they are "
"better then you."
msgstr ""
"もし、新兵がお前を追い詰められるなら、彼らの言う通り、きっと優秀なのだろう"
"な。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/02_A_Practice_Bout.cfg:428
msgid ""
"And so the natural order reasserts itself, quite a pleasing sight to behold."
msgstr ""
"そうして、然るべき序列が再び構築されるわけだ、見ていてとても楽しい眺めだな。"

#. [scenario]: id=03_Port_Assignment
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:5
msgid "Port Assignment"
msgstr "港町での任務"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:22
#: war_and_home/scenarios/19_Not_In_Vain.cfg:22
msgid "Hold until the end of turns"
msgstr "ターン終了まで持ちこたえる"

