msgid "Wesnoth"
msgstr "Wesnoth"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:159
msgid ""
"Though this first meeting was <i>tense</i> to say the least, we all managed "
"to move past it and grew to be friends over what was left of our training."
msgstr ""
"初めてお顔を拝見したということもあり、多少<i>緊張 </i>しましたが、何とか切り"
"抜けて、残りの訓練期間中に親しくなることができました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:162
msgid ""
"Oweomyr slightly mellowed out over these months and was, at the very least, "
"tolerable, even becoming cordial towards me and grudgingly respecting Caror."
msgstr ""
"Oweomyr はこの数カ月でやや柔和になって、少なくとも僕に対しては誠実に接し、"
"Caror に対しては不承不承ながら敬意を払ってくれるようになりました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:167
msgid ""
"Merynian, on the other hand, was nice and respectful, both to other trainees "
"and to us.\n"
"\n"
"We all bonded quite well and ended up in the same regiment at our graduation."
msgstr ""
"それに対して、Merynian は他の訓練兵や僕らにも礼儀正しく、敬意を払ってくれまし"
"た。\n"
"\n"
"全員がとても良い関係を築き、卒業時には同じ連隊に配属されることになりました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:174
msgid ""
"We had been mobilised to garrison Merlyc, a village slightly northeast of "
"the confluence of the Great River and the Listra.\n"
"\n"
"We were ordered to wait there and secure it for the arrival of an army led "
"by General Sidry.\n"
"\n"
"Afterwards we were to set out alongside his troops and head towards "
"Lintanir, both to train with the Northern Elves and to check on heightened "
"orcish activity and reports of a new great chief rising.\n"
"\n"
"However, neither elves nor orcs would be our first adversaries north of the "
"river."
msgstr ""
"僕らは、Great River と Listra 川の合流点からやや北東に位置する村、 Merlyc 駐"
"屯地に配備されていました。\n"
"\n"
"Sydry 将軍の率いる軍隊が到着するまで待機し、安全を確保するよう命じられたので"
"す。\n"
"\n"
"その後、北方エルフの訓練と、オークの活動活発化や新たな大族長の台頭の報告を確"
"認するため、その軍隊と共に Lintanir に向かうことになりました。\n"
"\n"
"しかし、エルフもオークも、まさか川の北側で最初の敵となることはないだろうと"
"思っていました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:183
msgid ""
"Chapter Three\n"
"<i>Port Assignment</i>"
msgstr ""
"第3章\n"
"<i>港町での任務 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=BL2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:201
msgid "Why's there a garrison here!?"
msgstr "なんでここに駐屯地があるんだよ！？"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:205
msgid "Don't care, kill'em fast and loot it all!"
msgstr "気にすんなって。さっさと奴らを殺して、ぜーんぶ奪っちまおうぜ！"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:209
msgid "Wretches..."
msgstr "惨めなものだ..."

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:213
msgid "Hold fast, the main forces will be here in a few days!"
msgstr "頑張るんだ！数日すれば主力部隊が到着するからな！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:245
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:385
msgid "What is happening here?"
msgstr "ここで一体何が起きているのだ？"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:255
msgid "Run away! Run away!!!"
msgstr "さっさと逃げろ！逃げるんだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:267
msgid "Finally! This is over!"
msgstr "遂に、終わりましたわ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/03_Port_Assignement.cfg:283
msgid "It seems we arrived too late for the battle. Ah well, no matter."
msgstr "戦地に着くのが遅すぎたようだな。まあ、良しとしよう。"

#. [scenario]: id=04_Road_To_Lintanir
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:5
msgid "Road To Lintanir"
msgstr "Lintanir への道"

#. [side]: id=OL1, type=Orcish Warrior
#. [side]: id=OL2, type=Orcish Crossbowman
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:113
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:131
msgid "Orcish Ambush"
msgstr "オークの伏兵"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:152
msgid ""
"Once the bandit raid had been repelled, we merged with the expeditionary "
"force and began to make our way on foot to Lintanir, the waters being "
"impracticable.\n"
"\n"
"Though some whispers of the orcish clannate uniting had reached Wesnoth, "
"they seemed little more than canteen gossip and were treated as such.\n"
"\n"
"Thus, when we stopped for the night, only a minimal watch was put in place."
msgstr ""
"山賊の襲撃を退けて遠征軍と合流し、水路が通行できないので徒歩で Lintanir に歩"
"を進めました。\n"
"\n"
"Wesnoth には、オークの氏族統合の風説が伝わっていましたが、酒保の世間話に過ぎ"
"ないと思われて、その程度にしか気にされていませんでした。\n"
"\n"
"そのため、夜間の宿泊時は必要最小限の見張りを立てるのみでした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:159
msgid ""
"Chapter Four\n"
"<i>Road To Lintanir</i>"
msgstr ""
"第4章\n"
"<i>Lintanir への道 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:183
msgid ""
"This is far enough for today, let us make camp in this abandoned village. "
"Turod, Caror, set up your camps south."
msgstr ""
"今日の行軍はここまでだ。この廃村で野営を行なう。Turod、Caror、南にキャンプを"
"張るように。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:187
msgid "Argh! What was that!?"
msgstr "アッ！　今のは何だ？"

#. [message]: type=Orcish Nightblade
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:251
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ha! They fell for our ambush, the fools!"
msgstr "ハーッ！　待ち伏せに引っかかったぜ、バカタレめ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:255
msgid "<span size='large'>cough* *cough* Orcs! To arms!</span>"
msgstr "<span size='large'><i>ゴホッ ゴホッ </i> オークどもだ！武器を取れ！</span>"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:264
msgid "We'll push south, general Sidry will handle the northern foe."
msgstr "私たちは南を攻めます、Sydry 将軍は北の敵をお願いします。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:276
msgid "This is taking too much time, tell the boss!"
msgstr "時間がかかりすぎちまう、ボスに伝えてくれ!"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:280
msgid "Prepare to push south, we will not reach Lintanir at this rate."
msgstr "南への進軍を準備せよ、この調子では Lintanir へ辿り着くことは難しい。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/04_Road_To_Lintanir.cfg:289
msgid "Break camp and prepare to move, we leave now."
msgstr "野営は中止し、移動の準備を行う。今すぐ出発だ。"

#. [scenario]: id=05_A_City_Besieged
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:5
msgid "A City Besieged"
msgstr "包囲された街"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:28
msgid "Reach the palace"
msgstr "宮殿に辿り着く"

#. [side]: id=EL, type=Elvish Marshal
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:141
msgid "Lintanir"
msgstr "Lintanir"

#. [side]: id=EL, type=Elvish Marshal
#. [modify_unit]
#. [side]: id=UL1, type=Revenant
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:147
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:37
#: war_and_home/scenarios/43_Where_Monsters_Fought.cfg:180
msgid "Eärindel"
msgstr "Eärindel"

#. [side]: id=OL1, type=Orcish Crossbowman
#. [side]: id=OL2, type=Orcish Warlord
#. [side]: id=OL3, type=Troll Hero
#. [side]: id=OL4, type=Orcish Warrior
#. [side]: id=OL1, type=Orcish Warlord
#. [side]: id=OL2, type=Orcish Warrior
#. [side]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:184
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:200
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:222
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:241
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:149
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:204
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:163
msgid "Orcish Army"
msgstr "オーク軍"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:260
msgid ""
"After having foiled the ambush, we moved fast and soon reached our "
"destination, the city of Lei'kan within the Lintanir forest."
msgstr ""
"待ち伏せを回避した後、僕たちは素早く移動して目的地へすぐに到着しました。"
"Lintanir の森にある Lei'kan の街です。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:263
msgid ""
"On the way we tried to have fun, talking about whatever passed through our "
"mind, to distract ourselves from the unease we felt regarding the unexpected "
"ambush we had gone through and what it could mean for the future."
msgstr ""
"その途中、僕たちは思いつくままに語り合って、楽しもうとしました。思いがけない"
"待ち伏せに遭ったことへの不安や、先行きの不安を紛らわせたかったのです。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:266
msgid ""
"We were quite on edge and desperate for any distraction so when Oweomyr "
"mentioned without thinking that he was wondering how the elven princess, the "
"heir to the Lintanir throne, looked like, we all took delight in gently "
"ribbing him on the subject of his supposed 'attractions' and it sustained us "
"for quite some time until we reached the forest's edge."
msgstr ""
"僕たちは極度に過敏な状態で、気を紛らわすことに必死になっていたので、Oweomyr "
"が何気なく、エルフの王女 --- Lintanir の王位継承者の容姿はどんなだろうと言っ"
"たときに、私たちみんなで Oweomyr 自身の”魅力”に関してやんわりと揶揄して楽し"
"み、森の端に着くまでの暫くの間、そうした雰囲気が続いていました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:269
msgid ""
"Chapter Five\n"
"<i>A City Besieged</i>"
msgstr ""
"第5章\n"
"<i>包囲された街 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=EL
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:290
msgid "No! The city is lost!"
msgstr "なに！？　街が無いぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:303
msgid ""
"We are close to the city yet haven't met any sentinel... Stay on your guard."
msgstr "街に近いが衛兵には遭遇していない... 油断するな。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:316
msgid ""
"Poor Oweomyr, we won't be able to rush in and meet the wonderful elven "
"princess awaiting us... How hard can a noble's life get..."
msgstr ""
"Oweomyr が可愛そうだね、我々は、突入して、素敵な王女様に謁見できそうにない、"
"お待ちになってるというのに... 貴族の生活は、なんとも厳しいものだな..."

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:320
msgid "(<i>Chuckles</i>)"
msgstr "<i>..うふふ.. </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:324
msgid "I only stated I would be interested in meeting elvish nobility..."
msgstr "エルフの貴族に会ってみたいと言っただけなんだがな..."

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:328
msgid ""
"Well, if ya believe ya have a chance, go for it... At least it'll be "
"entertaining."
msgstr ""
"チャンスがあると思ってるんなら、諦めちゃだめでしょ... 少なくとも、話が面白く"
"なりますよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:332
msgid "Ignorant commoners..."
msgstr "無知な庶民め..."

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:354
msgid "Orcs! Orcs!"
msgstr "オークだ！オークだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:358
msgid "To the city! Now!"
msgstr "街に向かうぞ！さあ！"

#. [message]: speaker=EL
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:381
msgid "Finally, reinforcements!"
msgstr "ついに援軍が来ましたぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=EL
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:389
msgid ""
"The orcs have been sieging us for a month and we are running low on troops. "
"What remains of our druid and rangers are surrounded north of here while "
"every royal but the princess is dead, however the orcs have breached the "
"palace and we have lost contact with her retinue!"
msgstr ""
"オークが1ヶ月もの間、我々を包囲し続けている。そして、我々は兵力不足だ。ドルイ"
"ド僧とレンジャーの残りは、ここから北の方で包囲されている。王女以外の貴族は全"
"員討ち死にし、それでもオークは宮殿を破壊して、王女の従者との連絡も絶たれてし"
"まった！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:393
msgid "Break the siege! Get to the palace!"
msgstr "包囲網を打ち破れ！宮殿へ向かえ！"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:408
msgid ""
"Finally! Turod, push in and find the princess. Caror, help us get the city "
"under control and then head north with your squad to help those druids!"
msgstr ""
"遂に来た！ Turod 、突入して姫を見つけ出せ。Caror 、街を制圧するから援護を頼"
"む。それが終わったら、君の部隊と北へ向かってくれ、ドルイド僧を救い出すのだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:412
msgid "Oweomyr, since ya wanna see her that bad, go with 'em."
msgstr "Oweomyr 、それほど彼女に会いたいなら、Turod たちと一緒にどうぞ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:416
msgid "This again? Fine, I shall humor you..."
msgstr "またその話か？いいだろう、話に乗ってやるよ..."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:474
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:337
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:216
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:295
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:363
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:244
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:208
#: war_and_home/scenarios/16_To_The_Harbour.cfg:243
#: war_and_home/scenarios/17_Break_Through.cfg:195
#: war_and_home/scenarios/18_Fateful_Reunion.cfg:262
#: war_and_home/scenarios/22_A_Desolate_Land.cfg:236
#: war_and_home/scenarios/23_The_Monastery.cfg:196
#: war_and_home/scenarios/25_A_Lone_Village.cfg:264
#: war_and_home/scenarios/26_Encircled.cfg:248
#: war_and_home/scenarios/32_Like_Waves_Upon_The_Rocks.cfg:260
#: war_and_home/scenarios/34_Battle_Of_Carcyn.cfg:293
#: war_and_home/scenarios/35_Elensefar.cfg:413
#: war_and_home/scenarios/37_Flames_Over_Glamdrol.cfg:208
#: war_and_home/scenarios/43_Where_Monsters_Fought.cfg:379
msgid ""
"The sound of great wardrums resounds in the distance, announcing death and "
"the end of hope."
msgstr ""
"大きな陣太鼓の音が遠くに鳴り響いています。死と、希望の終焉を告げているので"
"す。"

#. [message]: speaker=EL
#: war_and_home/scenarios/05_A_City_Besieged.cfg:480
msgid "How!? How can they have even more troops!?"
msgstr "どうすればよいの！？　どうすれば、これ以上の軍隊を持てるのでしょう！？"

#. [scenario]: id=06_Evacuate
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:5
msgid "Evacuate"
msgstr "宮殿からの脱出"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:29
msgid "Leave no enemies between the princess and the southern exit"
msgstr "王女と南出口との間にいる敵を全て倒す"

#. [side]
#. [scenario]: id=07_The_North_Fall
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:134
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:145
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:103
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:32
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:68
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:82
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:55
#: war_and_home/scenarios/15_A_Brief_Respite.cfg:36
#: war_and_home/scenarios/17_Break_Through.cfg:36
#: war_and_home/scenarios/18_Fateful_Reunion.cfg:41
#: war_and_home/scenarios/19_Not_In_Vain.cfg:48
#: war_and_home/scenarios/20_Arrival_And_Warning.cfg:36
#: war_and_home/scenarios/33_Cornered_And_Slain.cfg:74
msgid "Elves"
msgstr "エルフ"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:259
msgid ""
"And thus, with Caror staying outside of the palace, Oweomyr, Merynian and I "
"rushed inside to help the princess."
msgstr ""
"こうして、Caror を宮殿の外に残したまま、 Oweomyr とMerynian 、僕の3人は王女を"
"救出すべく宮殿の中へと飛び込んでいったのです。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:262
msgid ""
"Chapter Six\n"
"<i>Evacuate</i>"
msgstr ""
"第6章\n"
"<i>宮殿からの脱出 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:296
msgid ""
"Alright, we'll advance through the palace and try to help out the elves as "
"much as we can."
msgstr "よし、王宮を突き進んでいってエルフをできるだけ救い出しましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:300
msgid ""
"With the amount of rubble, tis a miracle we managed to get that far, the "
"rest of our troops probably won't reach us."
msgstr ""
"この瓦礫の量で、あんな所まで行けたのが奇跡だな。残りの兵は、来れないだろう"
"な。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:304
msgid ""
"Brother, we know, but we still need to reach the princess as fast as "
"possible and we couldn't have advanced in formation."
msgstr ""
"お兄さま、分かりますけど、それでも一刻も早く王女さまのところへ行く必要があっ"
"たから、隊列を組んだまま進むのは無理だったのです。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:313
msgid "On the other side of many orcs, a different conversation took place."
msgstr ""
"多数のオークのいた、その反対側では、違った会話が繰り広げられていました。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:317
msgid "This position is becoming untenable, we shall soon need a better one."
msgstr ""
"この場所は攻撃に耐えられなくなりつつあります、いずれ、もっといい場所が必要に"
"なるでしょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:321
msgid ""
"There are no others that we can reach, our only hope would be charging south "
"to the main gate!"
msgstr ""
"他には行けそうな場所がないな、正門のある南側に攻撃を仕掛ける、それしかありま"
"せん！"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:325
msgid ""
"Though it pains me to say so, we must do so now for the forces to the north "
"are too strong for us."
msgstr ""
"こんなことを言うのは不本意ですが、すぐにも遂行するべきでしょう。北の勢力は強"
"すぎて、私達では敵いません。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:343
msgid "No! We are doomed if we remain stuck here!"
msgstr "ダメだ、ここで立ち往生したままでは、命運が尽きる！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:364
msgid "Humans, thank the Lost Light! The princess is further inside!"
msgstr "人間たちよ、失われた光に感謝を！王女様は、もっと奥にいらっしゃる!"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:368
msgid "Understood. Come with us for now, it'll be easier to get her out."
msgstr "はい。私達と今すぐ行きましょう、あの方を連れ出すのは簡単なことです。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:374
msgid "Every elven unit will be given to player 2 at the end of the scenario."
msgstr "全てのエルフユニットは、シナリオ終了時にプレイヤー２に渡ります。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:431
msgid "Humans!? Here!?"
msgstr "えっ、人間！？　ここに！？"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:435
msgid ""
"We are part of the Wesnoth Army that was to join your forces here. In any "
"case, this position seems untenable and our forces are securing the city as "
"we sepak."
msgstr ""
"私たちは Wesnoth 軍の者です。あなた方の軍隊と、ここで合流する予定でした。いず"
"れにしろ、この場所は耐えられそうにありませんし、お話したように私達の軍が街を"
"守っている最中です。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:439
msgid ""
"Then let us hold with our combined strengths until other reinforcements "
"reach us!"
msgstr "それでは、他の援軍が到着するまで、力を合わせて頑張り抜きましょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:443
msgid ""
"We have neither the men nor the time to do so, we must evacuate the palace "
"and take it back later. (<i>Looks at his two friends</i>) Instead of "
"gawking, could you maybe help convince them?"
msgstr ""
"そんな人員も時間も私達にはありません、一旦、宮殿から避難し、あらためて取り戻"
"すしかないのです。（<i>友人二人を見て </i>）おいおい、見とれてないで、説得す"
"るのを手伝ってくれないのか？"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:447
msgid ""
"(<i>As if awakening from a trance</i>) Uh— Yes indeed it would be better to "
"join the main forces outside."
msgstr ""
"（<i>まるでトランス状態から目覚めたように </i>）えっと......そうなんです、外"
"にいる本隊と合流したほうが得策ですよ、はい。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:451
msgid ""
"Ye—Yes, we do not know when the troops outside will have finished clearing "
"the city."
msgstr "えぇ...そうなんです、いつ、外の部隊が街から撤収するか分かりませんし。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:455
msgid ""
"Very well, we shall do as you say. Lead the way out, our people will follow "
"suit."
msgstr ""
"よろしい、あなたがたの言葉に従いましょう。道を切り開いてください。我が民は、"
"あなた方の後に続きます。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:476
msgid "Happily enough, we have cleared it behind us."
msgstr "なんとも幸運なことに、私たちは乗り越えられました。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:482
msgid "The way is clear, let us leave as fast as possible!"
msgstr "道が開けました、一刻も早く出発いたしましょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:490
msgid ""
"Those amongst your people that joined us will be rejoiced to serve you once "
"more, o fair one."
msgstr ""
"我らと行動を共にしたエルフの方々は、再び貴方に仕えることを楽しみにすることで"
"しょう。あぁ、公正な王女様よ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:513
msgid ""
"Thank you for keeping them safe, gracious knight. Isandir shall assist your "
"kind in coordinating with us."
msgstr ""
"彼らを守ってくれたことに感謝しましょう、優しき騎士よ。今後は Isandir が我々と"
"連携しながら、あなたを補佐します。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:517
msgid ""
"(<i>Looking at Oweomyr with an air of jealousy before bowing to his ruler</"
"i>) As you wish, my Lady—Ouch! (<i>He staggers, looking weakened</i>)."
msgstr ""
"（<i>王女に頭を下げる前に、嫉妬に満ちた表情で Oweomyr を見て </i>）仰せのまま"
"に、王女様 -----　痛い！（<i>弱った様子でフラフラとよろめく </i>）。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:521
msgid "(<i>Rushing to his aid</i>) Are you unwell?"
msgstr "（<i>彼を支えようと駆け寄り </i>）具合が悪いのですか？"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:534
msgid ""
"(<i>Muttering</i>) Those two are unbelievable... (<i>Speaking to the "
"princess</i>) We shall find some healers for your men amongst our own while "
"you finish assembling your people. Oweomyr will go with you to ensure good "
"communications, if that is alright with you."
msgstr ""
"（<i>ブツクサと </i>）あの二人はすごいな...（<i>王女に語りかける </i>）そちら"
"の方々が集合するまでの間、そちらの兵のために私達の仲間の中から治療師を探して"
"おきます。Oweomyr があなたにお供いたしますので、意思の疎通をお図りください、"
"もしよろしければ、ですが。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/06_Evacuate.cfg:538
msgid "That is acceptable. Let us leave the palace."
msgstr "ええ、かまいません。さあ、宮殿を離れましょう。"

#. [scenario]: id=07_The_North_Fall
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:7
msgid "The North's Fall"
msgstr "北方地域の陥落"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:219
msgid ""
"We left the palace as fast as possible, evacuating the princess as well as "
"the civilians under her protection."
msgstr ""
"僕たちは、可能な限り急いで宮殿を後にしました。王女とその庇護下にある市民を避"
"難させるために。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:222
msgid ""
"Chapter Seven\n"
"<i>The North's Fall</i>"
msgstr ""
"第7章\n"
"<i>北方地域の陥落 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:296
msgid "Finally, we have escaped the palace. How do you fare, my lady?"
msgstr "とうとう宮殿を抜け出しました。王女様、体長はいかがでしょう？"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:300
msgid "Why quite fine, dear knight, and so do the rest of my kin."
msgstr "非常に良好ですよ、親愛なる騎士よ、私の親族も大丈夫です。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:304
msgid "How does the wound look?"
msgstr "傷の具合はいかがですか？"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:308
msgid "Tis but a scratch, though I thank you for your concern."
msgstr "かすり傷程度だが、お気遣いに感謝するよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:312
msgid "Now we just need to link up with the rest of the army."
msgstr "あとは残りの軍と合流するのみです。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:316
msgid ""
"Indeed, I await with joy our reunion with Eärindel. I hope our survival "
"shall impress my dear teacher. Afterwards we shall have to find Anówien and "
"Sylindë and tell them all about it."
msgstr ""
"そうですね、Eärindel と再会できることが楽しみで待ちきれません。私たちが存命で"
"あることで、私の親愛なる師を驚かせられればよいのですが。そのあと、 Anówien "
"と Sylindë を探し出して、このことを伝えなければなりません。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:328
msgid "Oh lords."
msgstr "ああ、神よ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:332
msgid "Eärindel, no!"
msgstr "Eärindel 、そんな！"

#. [message]: speaker=BB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:336
msgid "This has gone on long enough. Today, Lintanir falls!"
msgstr "もう十分だろう。今日、Lintanir は陥落ぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=EL
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:363
msgid "I'm sorry, Princess..."
msgstr "残念です、王女様..."

#. [message]: speaker=B1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:372
msgid "All hail Great Chief Vrodar!"
msgstr "Vrodar 大首領、万歳！"

#. [message]: speaker=OG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:376
msgid ""
"(<i>As one, the orcish horde taks up its warcry, screams resounding from "
"every direction</i>) All hail Great Chief Vrodar!"
msgstr ""
"（<i>オークの群れは一斉に叫び声を上げ、四方から悲鳴が響いていた </i>）Vrodar "
"大首領、万歳！"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:381
msgid ""
"(<i>The princess is frozen in place, shocked to her core at the loss of a "
"mentor</i>) E—Eärindel, how..."
msgstr ""
"（<i>恩師を失ったことに心から衝撃を受け、その場に立ちすくむ王女 </i>） E... "
"Eärindel 、どうして...。"

#. [message]: speaker=HG2
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:385
msgid ""
"Ouch... I won't get far like this... Turod, evacuate with the elves and your "
"team, warn the realm!"
msgstr ""
"痛い... これでは、遠くへは行けぬ... Turod よ、エルフと一緒に避難せよ、領土内"
"に警告せよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/07_The_North_Fall.cfg:389
msgid ""
"Understood. It's been an honor, sir. (<i>To Isandir</i>) Gather your people, "
"we leave now. (<i>To Oweomyr</i>) Grab the princess and follow us."
msgstr ""
"承知しました。光栄に思います、閣下。（<i>Isandir へ </i>）仲間を集めてくださ"
"い、今すぐ出発します。（<i>Oweomyr へ </i>）王女をつかまえて、私たちについて"
"きてください。"

#. [scenario]: id=08_Flight_Through_The_Woods
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:5
msgid "Flight Through The Woods"
msgstr "森を抜ける脱出行"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:25
msgid "Reach the southern end of the map"
msgstr "マップの南端に到達する"

