#: war_and_home/scenarios/27_Into_The_Dark.cfg:125
msgid "Orcish Forces"
msgstr "オーク軍"

#. [side]: id=TL1, type=Great Troll
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:137
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr "トロル"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:155
msgid ""
"The flight from the capital was a truly horrible moment for all of us. We "
"were scared of what stood behind us and afraid of what lay ahead."
msgstr ""
"首都からの脱出は、僕たち全員にとって本当に恐ろしい時間でした。僕たちは、背後"
"にそびえるものに怯え、前途に広がるものにも怯えていました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:158
msgid ""
"The princess recovered slightly from her teacher's death, both through the "
"support of Oweomyr and her duties to her people. It also kept her's as well "
"as Isandir's mind from thinking about the friends whose lives they feared "
"for."
msgstr ""
"王女は、Oweomyr の支えと民への責務もあって、師の死からわずかに立ち直っていま"
"した。このことはまた Isandir 同様に彼女が、危険に晒されている友人たちについて"
"思い苦しむことからも遠ざけてくれたのです。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:161
msgid ""
"We had our own to fear for, with Caror stuck somewhere north, and needed to "
"help with the retreat towards safer lands."
msgstr ""
"僕たち Wesnoth 軍は Caror が北方で身動きがとれない状況に陥っていないか案じて"
"いて、より安全な場所への退却を支援する必要がありました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:164
msgid ""
"We headed south, trying to reach Wesnoth and safety. The elves' speed in "
"forest as well as General Sidry's sacrifice bought us time and enabled us to "
"avoid major engagements, or at least, until the edge of the woods..."
msgstr ""
"Wesnoth に安全に着けるように南へと向かいました。森林でのエルフの速さと Sidry "
"将軍の自己犠牲によって移動時間が短縮され、大規模な交戦は回避できました。少な"
"くとも森の端までは..."

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:167
msgid ""
"Chapter Eight\n"
"<i>Flight Through The Woods</i>"
msgstr ""
"第8章\n"
"<i>森を抜ける脱出行 </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:185
msgid ""
"We are nearing the forest's edge and the beginning of the southern mountains."
msgstr "私たちは、森の端と南の山の麓へと近づきつつあります。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:189
msgid ""
"Through the mountains and south of the Listra's tributary there should "
"hopefully be boats, or at least a narrowing of the river, enough for "
"improvised transports."
msgstr ""
"山々を越えた先の Lista 川支流の南側には、おそらく船があるか、又は、少なくとも"
"川幅が狭まるので、間に合わせの輸送手段を仕立てるには十分でしょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:194
msgid ""
"Pillage it all! (<i>He notices the motley crew of humans and elves</i>) Oh "
"my, survivors from Chief Vrodar's assault on Lintanir? We'll finish the job, "
"right, big boy?"
msgstr ""
"全部奪っちまえ！（<i>人間とエルフの雑多な一団に気づき </i>）おおっと、Vrodar "
"首領が Lintanir を襲撃したときに生き残ったか？お仕事は最後までやらなきゃ、だ"
"よな？"

#. [message]: speaker=TL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:198
msgid "Vrodar said so."
msgstr "Vrodar 、そう言ったよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:203
msgid "Kill them! They shall pay for our home!"
msgstr "あの者たちを殺しなさい！故国へ償いをさせるのです！"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:207
msgid ""
"(<i>Muttering</i>) We need to hurry south, not kill everything from here to "
"there..."
msgstr ""
"（<i>ブツクサと </i>）南へ急がねばなりませんので、ここからあそこまで全部殺す"
"とおっしゃっても..."

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:222
msgid "N—no! Oh lords please no..."
msgstr "いや——！　お願いだから、やめなさい..."

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:232
msgid ""
"Everyone, advance! We need to get through these mountains as fast as "
"possible!"
msgstr "さあみんな、先に進もう！なるべく早くこの山を通り抜けねば！"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:261
msgid "And so we finally reach you, scum. Let's finish this!"
msgstr "さぁ、遂にご対面だな、クズども。終わりにしようぜ！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:265
msgid ""
"He has access to too many reinforcements right now, we won't defeat him like "
"this. Everyone head south!"
msgstr ""
"あいつは今、多すぎるほどの援軍を呼べる。このまま彼を倒すのは無理だ。さあみん"
"な、南へ向かうんだ！"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:279
msgid "No! I will not disappoint Chief Vrodar! I will return, scum!"
msgstr ""
"Vrodar 首領を裏切るわけにはいかねえ！オレは戻ってくるからな、クズどもめ！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: war_and_home/scenarios/08_Flight_Through_The_Woods.cfg:294
msgid "Yes! We have reached the mountains!"
msgstr "やった！山までたどり着いたぞ！"

#. [scenario]: id=09_Lose_The_Orcs
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:5
msgid "Lose The Orcs"
msgstr "オークを振り切れ"

#. [side]: id=DL1, type=Drake Flare
#. [side]: id=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:126
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:153
msgid "Drake Tribe"
msgstr "ドレーク族"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:143
msgid ""
"Though we managed to reach the mountains before the enemy, they were still "
"right behind us, and our scouts informed us the main force was not far "
"behind the wolf riders."
msgstr ""
"何とか敵より先に山に着きましたが、敵はまだ僕たちのすぐ背後にいて、斥候の情報"
"によると、本隊はウルフライダーの後方にいるとのことでした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:146
msgid ""
"We could not outrun them forever and so chose to stand our ground at an "
"advantageous location.\n"
"\n"
"This way, we could take out their vanguard and buy ourselves some time."
msgstr ""
"永遠に逃げ切れるわけではないので、僕たちは有利な場所に陣取ることを選択しまし"
"た。\n"
"\n"
"そうすれば、相手の先発隊を倒して時間を稼ぐことができるはずだから。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:151
msgid ""
"Chapter Nine\n"
"<i>Lose The Orcs</i>"
msgstr ""
"第9章\n"
"<i>オークを振り切れ </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:172
msgid ""
"My death doesn't matter, our main forces are a few days away. You will all "
"die!"
msgstr "俺が死のうが関係ねえよ、主力隊が2､3日で着いて、お前ら全員死ぬんだよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:184
msgid "The flames of my kin shall avenge me!"
msgstr "我が一族の火サーいがオレの敵を討つ！"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:198
#, fuzzy
msgid "You have lost your lead! Now, you will fall!"
msgstr "お前ら、勢いがなくなっちまった！　これでお終いだな！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:202
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With their forces spread throughout the mountains, he'll be easier to take "
"down here."
msgstr "奴らの軍勢は山中に広がっていて、ここなら簡単に倒せるな。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:217
msgid "You ssstand on the land of the Darkanor Tribe, pay tribute or die!"
msgstr ""
"お前は Darkanor 族の土地に、立ってるぞ。貢ぎ物を出スーか、シーぬかだゾ！"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:221
msgid ""
"(<i>Bowing respectfully</i>) We meant no offense, o fiery one. We seek only "
"refuge from these monsters."
msgstr ""
"<i>（敬意を表してお辞儀して ）</i>悪気はありません、炎のようなお方。私達は、"
"あそこにいる怪物からの避難場所を探しているのです。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:225
msgid "Your plight matters not, only your trespassss does."
msgstr "そちらが困っていようが関係無い、シー 侵入してるぞ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:229
msgid ""
"(<i>To his allies</i>) Should we truly stoop so low as to pay a glorified "
"ramson?"
msgstr ""
"（<i>味方に向かって </i>）我々は、見掛け倒しのネギの代金を支払うほどに、自ら"
"を卑下する必要が本当にあるのだろうか？"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:233
msgid "We need those resources for our people."
msgstr "私たちは、そうした食料が国民のために必要なのです。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:237
msgid "Perhaps, but we do not need more enemies."
msgstr "多分、もうこれ以上敵を作る必要はありませんよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:242
msgid "Should we pay the tribute?"
msgstr "貢ぎ物でも納めるべきかな？"

#. [option]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:247
msgid "Yes, we have enough enemies as is (Lose 100 gold each)."
msgstr "そうですね、これ以上の敵は不要ですよ。（1人 100 gold ずつ失う）"

#. [option]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:249
msgid "Yes, we have enough enemies as is (Lose 200 gold)."
msgstr "そうですね、これ以上の敵は不要ですよ。（200 gold 失う）"

#. [option]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:254
msgid "No, we require these supplies."
msgstr "いいえ、いくらかの物資は必要です。"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:273
msgid "I have no time for you. Take this and let me end them."
msgstr "オレは時間がねえんだ。これをアンタらにやって、終わりにしてやる。"

#. [message]: speaker=B4
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:279
msgid "The clans do not recognize you, wretch!"
msgstr "オレの一族はお前らを認めないぞ、卑劣な奴どもめ！"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:301
msgid "No! We were almost out!"
msgstr "何てこと、終わりかけていたのに！"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:316
msgid ""
"The enemies are dead and the price isss paid. I sssuggest leaving sssoon."
msgstr ""
"敵はシーんだし、対価もシー払われた。サーッさとシューッ発したほうがいいぞ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:331
msgid "Now that the enemies are dead, what shall we do?"
msgstr "あのう、敵は死んでしまいましたわ、この後、何をすればよろしいの？"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:335
msgid "Send out the scouts and prepare to get back on the road."
msgstr "斥候を先発させて、元の道に戻る準備をしましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Tribute hasss been paid and my duty isss done. I sssuggest leaving our lands "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"貢ぎ物は貰ったシー、オレのシー事は終わった。サーッさと立ちサーってくれよな。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:424
msgid "I sssee orcs are the sssame as alwaysss... And for that you shall pay!"
msgstr "オークはいつもと同じだな... 代ショーは払ってもらうぞ！"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:443
msgid ""
"At leassst orcsss underssstand the price of tressspassssing. You shall learn "
"it."
msgstr ""
"スーくなくともオークは、無断立ち入り料をショー知してる。お前も覚えとくんだ"
"な。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/09_Lose_The_Orcs.cfg:449
msgid ""
"Insssulting the Darkanor tribe was the lassst missstake any of you shall "
"ever make!"
msgstr "Darkanor 族を侮ったのが、お前らの侵シーたサーい大の過ちだったな！"

#. [scenario]: id=10b_Unexpected_End
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10B_Unexpected_End.cfg:5
msgid "Unexpected End"
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10B_Unexpected_End.cfg:65
msgid ""
"Against all odds, Turod and Oweomyr's desperate rearguard action against the "
"orcs led to the death of great chief Vrodar and, after a few months of "
"infighting, the collapse of their invasion force.\n"
"\n"
"This unimaginable opportunity was used to its full effect, as the armies of "
"Wesnoth and elvenkind pursued the orcs back to the Far North."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10B_Unexpected_End.cfg:70
msgid ""
"Whether Turod and Oweomyr succeeded by force of arms, well-honed tactics, or "
"through divine intervention would never be known, for the orcs made sure to "
"kill all in retribution.\n"
"\n"
"However, this did little to dampen the enthusiasm with which the bards told "
"of this valiant battle, for there had come two new legends to stand in the "
"pantheon of history's heroes."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10B_Unexpected_End.cfg:75
msgid ""
"The others did their part in this tale, leading the counterattack while "
"protecting the civilians, including Caror, who rejoined the main army at "
"Merlyc with other elven survivors.\n"
"\n"
"They all fought courageously, and well earned the peace that came.\n"
"\n"
"Though sadness and longing filled their hearts at the thought of those they "
"had lost and would never see again, they kept diligently to their duties, "
"all the better to ensure that the lives lost would be well-spent."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=10_Hold_The_Line
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:5
msgid "Hold The Line"
msgstr "退き口の戦い"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:32
msgid "Hold as long as possible"
msgstr "できるだけ長く敵を足止めする"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:36
msgid "Death of Turod"
msgstr "Turod の死"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:40
msgid "Death of Oweomyr"
msgstr "Oweomyr の死"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:191
msgid ""
"As we finished our preparations, the scouts returned with news. Bad news."
msgstr ""
"出発の準備を終えると、斥候が知らせを持って戻ってきました。悪い知らせでした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:194
msgid ""
"The main enemy forces were less than a day away. With our troops exhausted "
"and our supplies low, we would not be able to outrun nor defeat them."
msgstr ""
"敵の主力部隊が到着するまでには、あと1日足らずでした。こちらの兵力は消耗し、物"
"資も不足している中、逃げおおせることも戦いで打ち負かすこともできないでしょ"
"う。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:197
msgid "In other words, someone would have to slow them down."
msgstr "つまり、誰かが敵の足止めをする必要がありました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:200
msgid ""
"Chapter Ten\n"
"<i>Hold The Line</i>"
msgstr ""
"第10章\n"
"<i>退き口の戦い </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:263
msgid "Everyone is ready to move, we can leave right now."
msgstr "全員、準備ができています。今すぐにでも出発できますよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:267
msgid "Perhaps, but we will not reach anywhere with these enemies."
msgstr "しかし、こんな敵の状況下では、どこにも逃げ切れぬかもしれませぬ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:271
msgid "We still have to try."
msgstr "まだまだ、行動あるのみ、やってみなければ分かりません。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:275
msgid "We'll need some people to hold the enemy back while the rest escape."
msgstr "数人で敵を足止めする必要があるな。その間に残りが逃げるのだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:279
msgid "I'll handle setting up the defenses."
msgstr "防御の準備は僕がやりますよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:283
msgid "Wait... No!No!No! We have lost enough people as is!"
msgstr "待ってください... ダメですダメです、もうかなりの兵を失っているのです！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:287
msgid ""
"I am the best strategist we have. I'll be able to hold them back the "
"longest. We need time and we must buy as much as possible."
msgstr ""
"私は戦略を立てることに長けているんです。長く彼らを引き留めるには私が適任で"
"す。時間が必要です、できるだけ多くの時間を稼がなければなりません。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:291
msgid "(<i>To his sister</i>) It's no use... He's right."
msgstr "（<i>妹に </i>）いいさ... 彼の言うとおりだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:295
msgid ""
"(<i>Holding back tears</i>) We have already lost Caror, I don't want to lose "
"anyone else..."
msgstr ""
"（<i>涙をこらえて </i>）既に Caror もいません、これ以上、誰も失いたくないの"
"に..."

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:299
msgid "Godspeed."
msgstr "お任せください。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:334
msgid "I thank you. Your sacrifice shall be remembered."
msgstr "感謝いたします。あなたの尊い犠牲は、忘れられることはありません。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:348
msgid ""
"(<i>Trying to keep calm and collected</i>) All right, now to set up those "
"defenses."
msgstr "（<i>冷静、そして平静に努めながら </i>）よし、では防御を固めるんだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:365
msgid ""
"Why are you here... You're scaring at least two people by not being with "
"them."
msgstr "君、なぜここにいるんだ... 二人は君が一緒にいないと怖がるだろ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:369
msgid ""
"They don't yet know and you seemed too lonely like that... And in any case I "
"have a horse, so I'll be able to warn them how long we held."
msgstr ""
"まだ二人は知らないだろうが、お前はあんなに寂しそうにしていた...。いずれにせ"
"よ、私には馬があるから、どのくらい持ちこたえたか警告しに走ることができるだ"
"ろ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:373
msgid "Well then, make yourself at home."
msgstr "まあ、好きにしてくれ。"

#. [message]: speaker=BB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:403
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This was a long chase but it shall end soon. Kill them all and then hunt "
"down the rest!"
msgstr ""
"長い追跡だったが、もうすぐ終わりだ。全員ぶっ殺して、残りを追っかけるぞ!"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:407
msgid "Hold the line!"
msgstr "戦線を死守せよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:428
msgid "Fall back, tell them how long we held."
msgstr "後退して、どの程度持ちこたえたか報告してくれ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:438
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "さらばだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:464
msgid "Well, this is how it ends..."
msgstr "まあ、これでお終い、ってことだな..."

#. [message]: speaker=MC
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:503
msgid "Ouch... Won't hold much more..."
msgstr "痛いっ... もうこれ以上は無理だよ...。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:526
msgid "I am too wounded to remain here much longer."
msgstr "傷を負いすぎて、ここにこれ以上いられないな。"

#. [message]: speaker=BB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/10_Hold_The_Line.cfg:608
msgid "Nooooooooo!!!"
msgstr "嫌だーー！！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:61
#: war_and_home/scenarios/29_A_Haven_Assaulted.cfg:22
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "敵のリーダーを倒す"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:184
msgid ""
"While we were holding back the enemy army, Lumiclya, Merynian and Isandir "
"led everyone else southwest as fast as possible."
msgstr ""
"僕たちが敵軍を食い止めている間、Lumiclya 、Merynian 、Isandir の3人は残る全員"
"を率いて、可能な限り急いで南西へと向かいました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:187
msgid ""
"They were headed to the closest narrow part of the river. Once there, the "
"hope was to construct whatever rafts would be possible and cross to evade "
"the orcs."
msgstr ""
"彼らは川の、一番近くて川幅の狭まった箇所に向かっていました。そしてできるだけ"
"多くの筏を作り、オークから逃れるために川を渡るという計画でした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:190
msgid ""
"Chapter Eleven\n"
"<i>Mourn Later</i>"
msgstr ""
"第11章\n"
"<i>悼むのは脱出した後に </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:211
msgid "Noo! You will all burn one day!"
msgstr "クソー！　お前らだって、いつか焼かれる！"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:223
msgid "How... They looked half-dead..."
msgstr "なんじゃこりゃ... あいつら死にかけてると思ってたぜ..."

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:233
msgid ""
"We have taken over this ramshackle port. We need only build whatever boats "
"we can."
msgstr ""
"使い古されてガタガタですが、この港町を獲得いたしました。あとは、可能なだけの"
"船を作るだけです。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:237
msgid ""
"We have multiple shipwrights amongst our civilians. This should take but a "
"few days."
msgstr "市民の中に船大工が何人もいるのです。それでも2、3日はかかるでしょう。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:258
msgid ""
"Hold for two days <span color = 'white' size = 'small'>($countdown turns "
"left)</span>"
msgstr ""
"２日間維持する <span color = 'white' size = 'small'>(残り $countdown ター"
"ン)</span>"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:280
msgid "One more day should be enough!"
msgstr "あと１日あれば十分ですよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:321
msgid ""
"Wait... Where is my brother? He should have been back from the rear by now!"
msgstr "待って... お兄さまはどこかしら？もう後方から帰ってきているはずです!"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:325
msgid ""
"Indeed, where is he? We shall start a search but, though it pains me to say "
"so, we must still hurry to escape."
msgstr ""
"確かに、あの方はどちらにいらっしゃるのでしょう。捜索を開始いたしましょ"
"う......ただ、こう言っては何ですが、やはり脱出を急がねばなりません。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:329
msgid "(<i>Talking to herself</i>) Please, not him as well..."
msgstr "（<i>独白 </i>）お願いです、お兄さままで..."

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:333
msgid ""
"(<i>Trying to comfort her</i>) I am convinced he is unharmed. After all, he "
"is a strong warrior and a fast steed bears him."
msgstr ""
"（<i>彼女を慰めようと.. </i>）私は彼が無傷であると確信している。何しろ彼は強"
"い戦士であり、速い馬に乗っているのだから。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:337
msgid ""
"(<i>Talking to herself</i>) Let us hope he did not go back, I fear I would "
"suffer from this loss."
msgstr ""
"（<i>独白 </i>）お兄さまが戦線に引き返さなかったことを祈らなきゃ、お兄さまま"
"で失ったらと思うと、胸が苦しくなるわ。"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:342
msgid ""
"Oh my, people runnin' round these parts. Yall look like you're in a hurry. "
"Ah well, we'll be generous. Your money or your lives."
msgstr ""
"おやおや、この辺りじゃ人が走り回ってるぞ。お急ぎかな。まあ、俺たちゃ寛大なん"
"だ。金を出すか、命を出すか、どっちかなあ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:346
msgid ""
"We are being followed by an orcish army. If we remain here, they shall "
"overwhelm and kill us both."
msgstr ""
"私たちはオークの軍隊に追われています。ここに留まれば、彼らは押し寄せ、双方、"
"ともに殺されるでしょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:350
msgid "I don't care, I want stuff now. We'll just hide later."
msgstr "知ったこっちゃねえぜ。物がほしいんだ。その後、トンズラしてやるよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:354
msgid "You will receive nothing but death."
msgstr "お前らが手に入れるものなどない、死、以外はな。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:369
msgid ""
"They have reached us and we still do not have the port, we are going to die "
"stuck here!"
msgstr ""
"彼らがやって来たというのに、私たちはまだ港町を確保できていない。これでは討ち"
"死にしてしまう！"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:385
msgid "Well, that took some time."
msgstr "やれやれ、ちょっと時間が掛かったな。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:389
msgid "Brother, where were you!"
msgstr "お兄さま、どちらにいらしたのよ！"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:393
msgid "I was providing some assistance to a friend as well as advance warning."
msgstr "警告の知らせを持ち帰る以外に、友人を援助する用事もあったんだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:397
msgid ""
"I am thankful for your presence, dear knight, though pray tell, what news do "
"you bring?"
msgstr ""
"あなたがここに居ることに感謝します、親愛なる騎士よ。 しかし、教えてください、"
"どんな知らせなのでしょうか？"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:401
msgid "The enemy forces are less than a day away."
msgstr "敵の軍隊が来るまで、あと1日もありません。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:411
msgid "Then we need to hurry and secure the port as fast as possible."
msgstr ""
"ならば、急がねばならぬ、そしてできるだけ早く港の警備を固める必要がある。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:418
msgid ""
"Then we will need to prepare for a battle, for it shall take more than a day "
"before we may leave."
msgstr ""
"それなら、戦闘準備にかからねばならぬ、出撃までに１日以上はかかるだろう。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:425
msgid "That is the time it should take us to finish the ships."
msgstr "それは、船を完成させるために必要な時間だろうが。"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:432
msgid "We should be gone before their arrival."
msgstr "あの者どもが到着する前に、私たちは去らなければならぬのだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:439
msgid "Then please join us for we are almost ready to leave."
msgstr "では、そろそろ出発しますので、ご一緒してください。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:446
msgid ""
"If you see this message then it means something is bugged... Please tell me "
"on the forums."
msgstr ""
"もしこのメッセージが表示されたら、何か不具合があることを意味します。是非、"
"フォーラムでお知らせください。"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:453
msgid "And what news of Turod?"
msgstr "で、Turod に関する情報はありますか？"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:457
msgid "(<i>Lowering his head</i>) He held them that I might bring news."
msgstr "（<i>頭を垂れて </i>）私が知らせに走るため、彼は任務を引き受けたのだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:461
msgid ""
"(<i>After a moment of silence</i>) His sacrifice shall be remembered. Let us "
"make sure it was not in vain."
msgstr ""
"（<i>黙祷の後 </i>）彼の犠牲は決して忘れられることはありません。それが無駄で"
"なかったことを証明しましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:498
msgid ""
"Your ssstand wass dignified and impressed the flameborn. They have decided "
"to reward itsss bravery."
msgstr ""
"あなたの立ちスーがたは凛々シーかった、炎の民を感動さセーた。その勇シーに報い"
"ることに決めた。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:504
msgid "I thank them for their gift."
msgstr "彼らから贈られたものに感謝します。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:508
msgid "May its fire clear away your foes."
msgstr "ソーの炎がアンタの敵をいっソーせんことを祈る。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:514
msgid "I shall wield its blaze with pride."
msgstr "私はこの燃え立つ怒りを、誇りを持って振るうであろう。"

#. [message]: speaker=DL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:555
msgid "You slew our kin and survived the orcs. We shall finish this task."
msgstr ""
"お前は我が一族を殺シ、オークどもを生き延びサーせた。我々はこの任務を終わら"
"セーる。"

#. [message]: speaker=BL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:561
msgid "Ha! Seems you've got a lot of enemies!"
msgstr "ハー！　お前には、敵がた～くさん居るようだな！"

#. [message]: speaker=B1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:584
msgid ""
"And so we reach the rest of them. Kill them all, they must not reach their "
"lands!"
msgstr ""
"さあて、残りの奴らも手にかけるぞ。全員ぶっ殺すんだ。あいつらの土地に逃げ込む"
"前にな！"

#. [message]: speaker=EN
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:605
msgid "The transports are ready!"
msgstr "輸送船の準備が整いました！"

#. [message]: speaker=EP
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:609
msgid "Then let us leave now."
msgstr "では、今すぐに出発いたしましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=NB
#: war_and_home/scenarios/11_Mourn_Later.cfg:687
msgid "They are closer to the docks than us, we are cut off!"
msgstr "奴らのほうが船着場に近いな、通路を絶たれているぞ！"

#. [scenario]: id=12_Help_The_Shamans
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:5
msgid "Help The Shamans"
msgstr "呪術師を救え"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:119
msgid ""
"While Turod, Oweomyr and Merynian helped the princess escape her castle, "
"Caror headed north to help relieve Lintanir's shamans from the orcish "
"onslaught."
msgstr ""
"Turod 、Oweomir 、Merynian の3人が王女の脱出を手助けしている間、Caror は "
"Lintanir の呪術師をオークの猛攻から救うため北へと向かっていました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:122
msgid ""
"His journey there would become quite a great story and a tale worth putting "
"into paper."
msgstr ""
"その旅程は、記録に残されるほどの価値を持った、現実と想像の入り混じった大変な"
"物語となりました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:125
msgid ""
"Chapter Twelve\n"
"<i>Help The Shamans</i>"
msgstr ""
"第12章\n"
"<i>呪術師を救え </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=OL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:146
#: war_and_home/scenarios/22_A_Desolate_Land.cfg:258
msgid "Nooo!"
msgstr "ノーー！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:194
msgid ""
"Alright. I'm supposed to help them even though I've got no idea where they "
"are and I don't even know where I am..."
msgstr ""
"そうさ。僕は彼らを助けなければならないのに、彼らの居場所さえ見当がつかない"
"し、ここがどこなのかも分からない......。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:199
msgid ""
"The sounds of battle, horns and metal striking metal, resound from the north."
msgstr "北の方からは、角笛の音や金属同士がぶつかり合う戦闘の音が響いてきます。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:203
msgid "Well, I guess that's as good a hint as any..."
msgstr "おっ、あの音は、いい手掛かりになりそうだ。"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:222
msgid ""
"This was such a great time for Sylindë to take the scouts and run around. "
"“Oh, I want to find out what's happening in the city. We'll go have a "
"look!”... A lull in the fighting doesn't mean an end to it..."
msgstr ""
"Sylindë にとって、とても大事なときだったのよね。斥候を連れて走り回ってた。"
"\"うわぁ、街で何が起こっているのか知りたいわ。見に行きましょう！\"...とか言っ"
"ちゃって。戦闘が小康状態になったからって、終わったわけじゃ無いのに...。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:226
msgid "Kill all the elves!"
msgstr "エルフをみんな殺っちまえ！"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:230
msgid "I do so hate orcs... Where's Haldar when you need him..."
msgstr "オークなんて、大ッキライよ... こんなときに Haldar はどこにいるの..."

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:250
msgid "How are there more coming! The city must have fallen!"
msgstr "どうしてこんなに押し寄せてくるんだ！　街は陥落したに違いない！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:260
msgid ""
"Well, that's that. I was ordered to help you. I suppose we should head back "
"to the city."
msgstr ""
"まあ、それはそれとしてですね。私はあなたを助ける命を受けてきました。街に戻り"
"ましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:264
msgid ""
"We'll do so but first we have to find our lost scouts. I'll send out who I "
"have left and we'll move soon after."
msgstr ""
"うーん......その前に先ず、いなくなった斥候を探さないと。私は残っている人を送"
"り出して、その後すぐに移動します。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:268
msgid "Understood. We'll wait in that case."
msgstr "了解しました。お待ちしています。"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:299
msgid "Oh, humans? What brings you here?"
msgstr "あら、人間ですね？どうしてここに？"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:303
msgid ""
"We're part of Wesnoth's army. We were supposed to train with yours... though "
"I didn't think it'd be that realistic..."
msgstr ""
"私たちは Wesnoth 軍の兵士です。あなた方と合同訓練を行う筈だった...実現できた"
"かどうかは今では分かりませんが..."

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:307
msgid ""
"Well, that's more manpower, I won't complain! My name is Anówien and I am "
"the commander here."
msgstr ""
"あら、兵数が増えたから、文句なしでしょう！私は Anówien 、ここの司令官です。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:311
msgid "Understood ma'am, we'll help get rid of the orcs."
msgstr "了解です、奥様。オーク撃退のお手伝いをします。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL1
#: war_and_home/scenarios/12_Help_The_Shamans.cfg:331
msgid "Humans here? How!"
msgstr "人間がここに？　なんだと！"

#. [scenario]: id=13_Rescue_The_Scouts
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:5
msgid "Rescue The Scouts"
msgstr "斥候を救出せよ"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:146
msgid ""
"Lady Anówien received reports quite rapidly. The scouts were surrounded "
"southeast of our forces and were facing multiple enemy detachments."
msgstr ""
"Anówien 司令官は、非常に迅速に報告を受けました。我が軍の南東方向で斥候隊が包"
"囲されており、複数の敵の分隊と対戦しているとのことでした。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:149
msgid ""
"Caror and Anówien's combined army hurried there, though all the way a "
"certain elf was grumbling, frequently mentioning such words as “incompetent” "
"and “raised wrong”."
msgstr ""
"Caror と Anówien の連合軍はその場所へと急行したのですが、その道中、あるエルフ"
"が、「無能だ」「育ちが悪い」といった不満の言葉を、頻繁に口にしていました。"

#. [part]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:152
msgid ""
"Chapter Thirteen\n"
"<i>Rescue The Scouts</i>"
msgstr ""
"第13章\n"
"<i>斥候を救出せよ </i>"

#. [message]: speaker=EA
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:170
msgid "We need to get out of here and bring the news fast!"
msgstr "ここから脱出して、急いで知らせに行きましょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:175
msgid "There you are! Can't handle a few orcs... I am disappointed..."
msgstr ""
"こんなところにいたのですね！　数人のオークに手を焼いているなんて... 期待外れ"
"ね..."

#. [message]: speaker=EA
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:179
msgid "Mother! Now's not the time!"
msgstr "お母さま！　そんなこと言ってる場合じゃ無いでしょう！"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:183
msgid "Mother?"
msgstr "お母さま...って？"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:187
msgid ""
"Yes, she is my daughter. We'll talk about it later. For now, take the orcs "
"out."
msgstr ""
"ええ、私の娘ですわ。その話は、のちほど。とにかく今は、オークを倒すのです。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:192
msgid ""
"Sylindë is different from standard elvish marksmans (cold attack, better "
"melee, more health, more cold/fire resistance, better defense/movement on "
"frozen terrain)."
msgstr ""
"Sylindë はエルフの標準的な普通の射撃手と違い、非常に優れた能力の持ち主です"
"（冷気攻撃、優れた近接攻撃、優れた回復能力、優れた冷気/火炎耐性、凍土での優れ"
"た防御/移動力）。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:198
msgid ""
"Every elven unit except Sylindë will be given to player 1 at the end of the "
"scenario."
msgstr ""
"Sylindë 以外のエルフユニットは、シナリオ終了時にプレイヤー１に渡ります。"

#. [message]: speaker=EA
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:214
msgid "No! We're all going to die!"
msgstr "いけないわ、全員死んでしまう！"

#. [message]: speaker=ES
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:224
msgid "Now that you are safe, let's join the forces at the city."
msgstr "ほら、あなた、無事なんだから、街で軍に力を貸しましょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=EA
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:228
msgid ""
"We can't, they have been overrun! The city is lost and only a group of "
"humans and elves who fled south remain."
msgstr ""
"無理よ、制圧されてしまったの！街は失われて、人間とエルフの一団が南へ避難して"
"残っているだけなのよ。"

#. [message]: speaker=CF
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:232
msgid "We probably can't reach 'em, what with the orcish army in-between."
msgstr "彼らはオークの軍勢の向こう側ですので、おそらく合流は無理でしょう。"

#. [message]: speaker=EA
#: war_and_home/scenarios/13_Rescue_The_Scouts.cfg:236
msgid ""
"Indeed, and enemy forces are also on their way here. What should we do, "
"mother?"
msgstr ""
"確かに。それに敵軍もこちらへ向かっているわ。お母さま、どうすればいいの？"

#. [scenario]: id=14_Laying_Low
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:5
msgid "Laying Low"
msgstr "隠伏"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:29
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:378
msgid "Gather food"
msgstr "食料を調達する"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:33
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:338
msgid "Find shelter"
msgstr "避難場所を探す"

#. [side]
#: war_and_home/scenarios/14_Laying_Low.cfg:113
msgid "Wildlife"
msgstr "野生動物"

