#. [trait]: id=fading_4
#: war_and_home/utils/traits.cfg:9 war_and_home/utils/traits.cfg:36
#: war_and_home/utils/traits.cfg:63 war_and_home/utils/traits.cfg:90
msgid ""
"<i>Fading</i> units are afflicted with an illness that saps their life "
"force.\n"
"\n"
"It reduces their health and changes their very form, rendering them more "
"resistant against mundane weapons as well as the cold, though weakening them "
"against the flame and the arcane.\n"
"\n"
"If left untreated, such ailments can fester and have dark consequences for "
"the afflicted... as well as every unfortunate soul near them."
msgstr ""
"<i>衰弱 </i>ユニットは生命力が奪われていく病気に冒されています。\n"
"\n"
"これによりユニットの健康は害され、外観さえも変形していきます。一般的な武器に"
"よる攻撃や寒さへの耐性は高まりますが、魔法や炎に対しては耐性が低くなりま"
"す。\n"
"\n"
"罹患したまま放置すると悪化が進み、その者のみならず、周辺の不運な者へも悲惨な"
"結果をもたらすでしょう。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A tale of a rookie wesnothian officer and the part he, along with those "
#~ "he meets on his way, plays in a war against a new orcish onslaught\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "(Intermediate level, 38 out of 40-something scenarios playable).\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "If you have a save from an older version (pre 0.2.0) then some things "
#~ "might not work (I added a new 'first' scenario and I had messed up a few "
#~ "things), but it should be obvious if that's the case (the 'your heroes "
#~ "all being level 1 with no xp' kind of obvious). It should be fixable by "
#~ "reloading a save before the 'waiting' scenario but I'm not sure, "
#~ "sorry...\n"
#~ "Added Note: This is the last version where they might work."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Wesnoth の若手将校が、道中で出会った人々と共に、新たなオークの猛攻に立ち向"
#~ "かおうと活躍する物語。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "(中級レベル、全40シナリオ、プレイ可能なシナリオは38）。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "古いバージョン（0.2.0以前）のセーブデータの場合、いくつかうまく動作しない"
